# This site needs no environment variables.
#
# All content (recipes, events, travel, weekly menu, testimonials) is
# authored in src/content/ and shipped with the build. Forms (contact,
# booking, newsletter) submit straight to Netlify Forms, configured in the
# Netlify dashboard. Google Analytics uses a hard-coded measurement ID and
# only runs after cookie consent.
#
# There is intentionally nothing to copy into .env.local.
